		(property "ViaEvidence" "v0.9.7: V064-V075 confirmed; V064-V070 measured 11.2 kohm. IMG_2434 plus R18 1.2k + R19 10k supports PNP supply switch: E/R pin2 at VDD, B/L pin1 through R18 control and R19 pull-up. Terminal selection is a supported photo/circuit inference, not a separate user pad measurement."
			(at 176.53 203.2 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
		(property "CurrentEvidence" "B65/B66 confirm Q7.L-R19.1 and Q7.R-R19.2 at 1.5 ohm. B67-B70 diode polarity supports PNP/base at L; R=emitter/S=collector remains the 3GW/BC857C datasheet/circuit assignment, not a unique diode-test result. B71 direct V(R)-V(L)=0 V is consistent with no forward base-emitter bias in the latest powered state; this fits low TP5/VREF. Earlier separate R19 0/4.5 V readings remain conflicting history, not a failure diagnosis. Exact part, switching pulses and enabled-state behavior remain unverified."
